# Copy to .env for local work:  cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored. Nothing in this file is a secret -- the mnemonic below is
# go-zenon's devnet phrase, committed to that repo and worthless. The real
# faucet wallet lives in the FAUCET_MNEMONIC repository secret and is injected
# by .github/workflows/deploy.yml; it is never written down here.

# The wallet the page signs with. 24 words.
FAUCET_MNEMONIC="abstract affair idle position alien fluid board ordinary exist afraid chapter wood wood guide sun walnut crew perfect place firm poverty model side million"

# Which chain this build talks to. Every one of these is optional and falls
# back to the local devnet defaults in src/network.ts, which is what you want
# for `npm run dev` against `npm run setup:devnet`.
#
# A deployed build MUST set FAUCET_RPC_URL to an https:// or wss:// endpoint:
# GitHub Pages is served over HTTPS, and a page on HTTPS cannot call
# http://localhost -- the browser blocks it as mixed content.
#
# FAUCET_NETWORK_NAME=devnet
# FAUCET_RPC_URL=http://localhost:35997
# FAUCET_CHAIN_ID=69
# FAUCET_PP_ZTS=zts1529re5wj5fp40mkgnac2uz
# FAUCET_GLYPHS_ZTS=zts15m4ym7lqwvt0qn706863hl

# Sub-path the site is served from. The deploy workflow sets this to /<repo>/
# for a GitHub Pages project site; leave it unset locally.
# FAUCET_BASE_PATH=/

# Which BIP-44 account index of FAUCET_MNEMONIC to derive and sign with --
# m/44'/73404'/index', the same SLIP-0010 ed25519 derivation znn_cli_dart and
# Syrius use (see src/znn/wallet.ts). Not secret -- it's readable in the
# bundle regardless -- so in CI it's the FAUCET_ACCOUNT_INDEX repository
# *variable*, not a secret. Defaults to 3, the devnet dev account used by
# `npm run setup:devnet`.
# FAUCET_ACCOUNT_INDEX=3
